### Async Core - Production Phase Testing
### REST Client requests for phase 3 production features

### ============================================
### HEALTH CHECKS
### ============================================

### Quick Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Detailed Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/queue/health

### ============================================
### EMAIL QUEUE - JOB SUBMISSION
### ============================================

### Submit 2 Email Jobs
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipients": ["alice@example.com", "bob@example.com"],
  "subject": "Welcome to Async Core",
  "message": "This is a production-grade background processing system demonstration"
}

### Submit Single Email
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipients": ["test@example.com"],
  "subject": "Single Email Test",
  "message": "Testing single email submission"
}

### Submit Bulk Emails (20 recipients)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipients": [
    "user1@example.com",
    "user2@example.com",
    "user3@example.com",
    "user4@example.com",
    "user5@example.com",
    "user6@example.com",
    "user7@example.com",
    "user8@example.com",
    "user9@example.com",
    "user10@example.com",
    "user11@example.com",
    "user12@example.com",
    "user13@example.com",
    "user14@example.com",
    "user15@example.com",
    "user16@example.com",
    "user17@example.com",
    "user18@example.com",
    "user19@example.com",
    "user20@example.com"
  ],
  "subject": "Production Bulk Email",
  "message": "This demonstrates processing multiple jobs in parallel"
}

### ============================================
### EMAIL QUEUE - JOB STATUS
### ============================================

### Get Job Status (replace JOB_ID with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs/email1234567890sample1abc

### Get Email Queue Stats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/stats

### ============================================
### DASHBOARD - MONITORING
### ============================================

### Get Dashboard Overview
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/overview

### Get Queue Overview (Queues and DLQ)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/queues

### Get Redis Status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/redis

### Get Performance Metrics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/metrics

### Get Job History (Recent 20 jobs)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/history

### Get Job History (Custom limit)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/history?limit=50

### Get Dead Letter Queue Jobs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/dlq

### Get DLQ with Custom Limit
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/dlq?limit=50

### ============================================
### ERROR TESTING
### ============================================

### Missing Recipients
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "No Recipients",
  "message": "Should fail"
}

### Empty Recipients Array
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipients": [],
  "subject": "Empty Recipients",
  "message": "Should fail"
}

### Missing Subject
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipients": ["test@example.com"],
  "message": "No subject"
}

### Missing Message
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipients": ["test@example.com"],
  "subject": "No Message"
}

### Invalid Job ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs/invalid-job-id

### ============================================
### DASHBOARD WORKFLOW
### ============================================

### 1. Submit emails first
POST http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipients": ["demo1@example.com", "demo2@example.com"],
  "subject": "Demo Email",
  "message": "Demonstrating the production queue system"
}

### 2. Check overview immediately
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/overview

### 3. Check queues
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/queues

### 4. Check performance
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/metrics

### 5. Check history
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/history?limit=10

### 6. Check job status by ID (from step 1 response)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/jobs/email/jobs/email1234567890sample1abc

### 7. After jobs complete, check DLQ (if any failed)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/dlq

